{
  "name": "Small Cell Lung Cancer Module",
  "remarks": [
    "2026-08 remediation: the pre-fix module rolled its entire lifetime",
    "incidence check (Smoking_Status_Check -> Cancer_Risk_Assessment) once,",
    "~1 day after birth (Smoking_Status_Check's own Delay). At that age the",
    "`smoker` attribute has never been set by anything (LifecycleModule",
    "does not assign it until adolescence), so the `smoker == true` branch",
    "was structurally dead and the `smoker is nil` branch caught literally",
    "every newborn, sending 30% of all infants into a 0.2% SCLC roll --",
    "the module's entire disease burden was concentrated in the first day",
    "of life. Replaced with an 18+ Guard and an annual incidence loop",
    "(same re-enterable Delay+router idiom as pneumonia.json/CIDP.json)",
    "gated by an EVER-smoker test at age: ever-smokers 50+, 1.5e-04/yr;",
    "everyone else (never-smokers of any adult age, or ever-smokers under",
    "50, where SCLC is rare regardless of smoking history), 5e-06/yr --",
    "a 30x differential consistent with SCLC being the most strongly",
    "smoking-associated lung cancer subtype (Varghese AM et al., 'Small-",
    "cell lung cancers in patients who never smoked cigarettes,' J Thorac",
    "Oncol. 2014;9(6):892-896 -- SCLC in true never-smokers is rare enough",
    "to be case-report/small-series material; Govindan R et al., 'Changing",
    "epidemiology of small-cell lung cancer in the United States over the",
    "last 30 years,' J Clin Oncol. 2006;24(28):4539-4544, for the smoking-",
    "driven age/incidence pattern the SEER-derived schedule here targets).",
    "`smoker == true` alone is a trap -- LifecycleModule.quitSmoking clears",
    "it back to false with cumulative probability approaching 1 over a",
    "normal lifespan, so `smoker == true` OR `\"quit smoking age\" is not",
    "nil` is the correct ever-smoker test (same idiom bladder_cancer.json",
    "and lung_cancer/lung_cancer_probabilities.json use).",
    "",
    "Also fixed: Cough_Symptom, Hemoptysis_Symptom, and Chest_Pain_Symptom",
    "were Symptom states carrying a `codes` array instead of the required",
    "`symptom` string -- State$Symptom.process needs `symptom` and NPEs",
    "without it, discarding the whole patient record (a known instance",
    "flagged in this remediation's engine notes). Present_Symptoms (an",
    "Encounter) was never explicitly closed before Medical_Oncology_",
    "Encounter opened later in the same pass -- not a lint CRITICAL",
    "(nothing >=1 day elapses between the two opens, and Encounter re-entry",
    "auto-releases the prior reservation) but still an unclosed FHIR",
    "Encounter resource; added an explicit close.",
    "",
    "The treatment spine (Medical_Oncology_Encounter onward) is",
    "deliberately left untouched by this task -- Palliative_Care_Integration",
    "still uses the shared 103735009 CarePlanStart code flagged in",
    "task-1.10-report.md as a cross-module collision risk with any module",
    "using 103735009 as a Procedure, but no module in the current tree",
    "does (verified by search), so it is currently inert; out of this",
    "task's scope to re-architect further."
  ],
  "gmf_version": 2,
  "states": {
    "Initial": {
      "type": "Initial",
      "direct_transition": "Adult_Age_Guard"
    },
    "Adult_Age_Guard": {
      "type": "Guard",
      "allow": {
        "condition_type": "Age",
        "operator": ">=",
        "quantity": 18,
        "unit": "years"
      },
      "direct_transition": "SCLC_Annual_Check"
    },
    "SCLC_Annual_Check": {
      "type": "Delay",
      "range": {
        "low": 350,
        "high": 385,
        "unit": "days"
      },
      "complex_transition": [
        {
          "condition": {
            "condition_type": "And",
            "conditions": [
              {
                "condition_type": "Or",
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "condition_type": "Attribute",
                    "attribute": "smoker",
                    "operator": "==",
                    "value": true
                  },
                  {
                    "condition_type": "Attribute",
                    "attribute": "quit smoking age",
                    "operator": "is not nil"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "condition_type": "Age",
                "operator": ">=",
                "quantity": 50,
                "unit": "years"
              }
            ]
          },
          "distributions": [
            {
              "transition": "Symptom_Onset",
              "distribution": 0.00015
            },
            {
              "transition": "SCLC_Annual_Check",
              "distribution": 0.99985
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "distributions": [
            {
              "transition": "Symptom_Onset",
              "distribution": 0.000005
            },
            {
              "transition": "SCLC_Annual_Check",
              "distribution": 0.999995
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
